  "title": "Enact Announces 14% Increase to Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "RALEIGH, N.C., May 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Enact Holdings, Inc. (Nasdaq: ACT) (Enact) announced that its Board of Directors declared a quarterly dividend of $0.24 per common share, an increase of 14% from the prior quarter’s dividend. This dividend will be payable on June 18, 2026 to",
